        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50621975?u=7c31b9c189757e8f9b77b6a9af413227686001e0&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h2 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Removes <code class=\"notranslate\">ARTICLE #3 content</code> from the stacking context hierarchy diagram on the Stacking context guide.</li>\n<li>That node is not a stacking context: it has the default <code class=\"notranslate\">position: static</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">z-index: auto</code>, so it should not appear in the hierarchy of stacking contexts.</li>\n<li>Aligns the diagram with CSS stacking rules and with the discussion on the issue (including maintainer confirmation).</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #42705.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3796438416\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42705\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/42705/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42705\">#42705</a></p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Test plan</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Confirm the hierarchy diagram under “The hierarchy of stacking contexts in the above example is as follows:” no longer lists <code class=\"notranslate\">ARTICLE #3 content</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Confirm ARTICLE <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"702484266\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/3\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/3/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/3\">#3</a> and SECTION <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"702728240\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/4\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/4/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/4\">#4</a>–#6 remain listed as stacking contexts.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Spot-check that the surrounding explanation still matches the corrected diagram.</li>\n</ul>",
