        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4138486?u=43a6ea26a16dfcc44d25b0aa5bc8d33dd21003b4&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Fixed the example code that wasn't working.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The <code class=\"notranslate\">htmlFor</code> property is of type <code class=\"notranslate\">DOMTokenList</code> and cannot be split using <code class=\"notranslate\">split()</code>.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-elements.html#dom-output-htmlfor\" rel=\"nofollow\">HTML Spec</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Since this was a minor fix, there are no issues.</p>",
