        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22709264?u=a10979e7969de88f4862300d32505942cd748097&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h2 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Corrects the malformed <code class=\"notranslate\">vide/webm</code> MIME type in the <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;embed&gt;</code> example on the <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;noembed&gt;</code> documentation page.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The MIME type is corrected from <code class=\"notranslate\">vide/webm</code> to <code class=\"notranslate\">video/webm</code>.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Test plan</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Verified the change is limited to the MIME type in the example.</li>\n<li>Ran the relevant repository validation checks.</li>\n</ul>",
