        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28090444?u=c780fb9008575ecb1a83608525ad936bb43ff3db&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Correct the documented default values for the <code class=\"notranslate\">value</code> argument of <code class=\"notranslate\">WebAssembly.Global()</code>:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">externref</code> receives a reference to <code class=\"notranslate\">undefined</code>.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">anyfunc</code> receives <code class=\"notranslate\">null</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The previous wording grouped <code class=\"notranslate\">externref</code> with <code class=\"notranslate\">anyfunc</code> and incorrectly said that both default to <code class=\"notranslate\">null</code>. This distinction matters because an <code class=\"notranslate\">externref</code> containing <code class=\"notranslate\">undefined</code> is not a null reference.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Verified against the <a href=\"https://webassembly.github.io/spec/js-api/#defaultvalue\" rel=\"nofollow\">WebAssembly JavaScript API <code class=\"notranslate\">DefaultValue</code> algorithm</a>.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">markdownlint-cli2</code>, Prettier, and CSpell pass for the changed page.</li>\n<li>A Node.js runtime check confirms the documented <code class=\"notranslate\">externref</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">anyfunc</code> defaults.</li>\n<li>AI assistance: Codex was used to prepare this change; the submitter reviewed the patch.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #43140.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3946905681\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43140\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43140/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43140\">#43140</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45156",
            "title": "Fix externref default in WebAssembly.Global() docs",
