            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1038267?u=2bdc2da04baac8ac264ee93ae3327b0fa55bca85&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #45149.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5154675477\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45149\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45149/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45149\">#45149</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR adds the return type Safari exception to the return type section.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">To help developers handle edge cases.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Return type discussion in WECG:<br>\n<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5034727818\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/1055\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/webextensions/issues/1055/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/1055\">w3c/webextensions#1055</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #45149.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5154675477\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45149\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45149/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45149\">#45149</a></p>",
