            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8265836?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">These descriptions were inaccurate in various ways, describing the behaviour of these functions as \"clamping\", and that <code class=\"notranslate\">asIntN()</code> gave the value modulo 2^bits.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/numbers-and-dates.html#sec-bigint.asintn\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/numbers-and-dates.html#sec-bigint.asintn</a></p>\n\n\n\n",
