        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">As per <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4464305240\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44144\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44144/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44144\">#44144</a>, the instructions in the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Core/Styling_basics/Handling_conflicts#playing_with_inheritance_control_properties\" rel=\"nofollow\">Playing with inheritance control properties</a> section of the Learn area \"Handling conflicts\" lesson are not very clear.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR rewrites the section to make everything clearer, including adding more context and information.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #44144.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4464305240\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44144\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44144/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44144\">#44144</a></p>\n\n\n\n",
